{"3312350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "War Angels", "steam_appid": 3312350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War Angels</strong> is a narrative-driven hospital management game where survival comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat patients, manage scarce resources, and face impossible moral dilemmas.<br>Amputate or risk infection. Save a child or a journalist. Accept everyone, or protect your staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no good choices. Only consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While struggling to keep your war-torn hospital alive, you’ll face branching narrative arcs with multiple endings, each shaped by difficult moral dilemmas. Inspired by real events, every decision will challenge not only your ability to survive, but your own humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >War Angels – Main Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/ea3eb40abc8459f49c8ad7e871ea237d.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=852 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/ea3eb40abc8459f49c8ad7e871ea237d.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/ea3eb40abc8459f49c8ad7e871ea237d.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Craft medicine, improvise tools, and keep the hospital alive with whatever you can find.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When supplies are gone, the line between saving lives and harming them starts to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/bf334fff6ed91bc7d88efc8236c51d0a.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=852 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/bf334fff6ed91bc7d88efc8236c51d0a.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/bf334fff6ed91bc7d88efc8236c51d0a.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who gets treated first as bombs fall and soldiers close in.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t have time to save everyone, only time to choose.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7bfc3080a79999f7bda283e8dd51c0d3.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=852 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7bfc3080a79999f7bda283e8dd51c0d3.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7bfc3080a79999f7bda283e8dd51c0d3.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish policies that shape how your hospital operates in a warzone.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who deserves treatment?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what lines are you willing to cross?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a65767e5f10d0bcb5a89c763148911cb.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=852 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a65767e5f10d0bcb5a89c763148911cb.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a65767e5f10d0bcb5a89c763148911cb.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Doctors, volunteers, and patients struggle with hunger, fear, and despair.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep morale from collapsing… or watch everything fall apart from within.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/76fb9ed908b83d437e6cb740aa16aa10.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=852 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/76fb9ed908b83d437e6cb740aa16aa10.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/76fb9ed908b83d437e6cb740aa16aa10.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send rescue teams outside the hospital to bring back the wounded.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission could save many, or cost you the people you trust most.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a181c5548db5db8c4eae47fa66966f9e.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=852 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a181c5548db5db8c4eae47fa66966f9e.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a181c5548db5db8c4eae47fa66966f9e.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tension rises as factions within your hospital begin to clash.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morality or survival. Compassion or control.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will challenge your decisions, and they won’t stay silent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War Angels</strong> is a narrative-driven hospital management game where survival comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat patients, manage scarce resources, and face impossible moral dilemmas.<br>Amputate or risk infection. Save a child or a journalist. Accept everyone, or protect your staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no good choices. Only consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While struggling to keep your war-torn hospital alive, you’ll face branching narrative arcs with multiple endings, each shaped by difficult moral dilemmas. Inspired by real events, every decision will challenge not only your ability to survive, but your own humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vide