em_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a65767e5f10d0bcb5a89c763148911cb.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Doctors, volunteers, and patients struggle with hunger, fear, and despair.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep morale from collapsing… or watch everything fall apart from within.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/76fb9ed908b83d437e6cb740aa16aa10.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=852 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/76fb9ed908b83d437e6cb740aa16aa10.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/76fb9ed908b83d437e6cb740aa16aa10.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send rescue teams outside the hospital to bring back the wounded.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission could save many, or cost you the people you trust most.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a181c5548db5db8c4eae47fa66966f9e.poster.avif?t=1786530310\" width=852 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a181c5548db5db8c4eae47fa66966f9e.webm?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/a181c5548db5db8c4eae47fa66966f9e.mp4?t=1786530310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tension rises as factions within your hospital begin to clash.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_pa